'''Pixel''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[8-Bit Item Pack]] for 899 Robux. It is now only obtainable through trading as the [[Gamepasses|gamepass]] has since gone offsale.   

== Appearance ==
The whole knife is constructed out of square pixels, hence the name. Its blade is white and silver in color with a black outline. The guard and handle are both blue in color with black outlines as well.

== Trivia ==
* Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/361950297 8-Bit Sword].
* Upon purchasing the [[8-Bit Item Pack]], players would receive this knife, the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] pet [[Phoenix]], and the common [[Bitsplosion]] effect.
*When salvaged, it provides 105 godly [[shards]].
*It pairs with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] pet [[Phoenix]], making the  8-Bit set.

